sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Scheduler
  participant J as Journal
  participant H as HTTP Executor
  participant R as Receiver
  S->>J: commit attempt 1 sending
  H->>R: POST logical event E
  Note over H,R: read timeout; receiver may continue
  H->>J: append timeout / possible-send evidence
  alt policy permits retry and outcome is not blocked as ambiguous
    S->>J: consume manifest conditional retry node
    S->>J: commit attempt 2 sending
    H->>R: POST same event E, new attempt_id
    R-->>H: 204
    H->>J: append acknowledged
  else ambiguity policy stop/observe
    S->>J: mark delivery ambiguous
  end
